# RPG items and stats
@scenario tutorial_lesson_46
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/46_inventory_lab.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt open_inventory]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: The guest starts at 40 HP and carries two teas. Each useItem event consumes one and restores 20 HP. The paired fades illustrate the two events.
@label lab
> Play the item sequence -> demo
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label demo
# region open_inventory
[jes push scripts/scenes/inventory_lab.jes label compare]
# endregion
@label compare
[set tutorial_source scripts/scenes/inventory_lab.jes]
[set tutorial_excerpt healing]
ginger: Calculate the final HP and remaining inventory. Inspect those values from Java via getStats and getInventory. The icons are authored timeline cues; a live HUD would instead read the actual inventory and stats.
[jump lab]
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_46]
[flag tutorial_done_46]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_10]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: Set starting HP to 90 and rerun both events. What should happen?
> HP increases to 130. -> practice_hint
> HP stops at the configured maximum of 100. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: Each use consumes one item and restores its configured amount, capped at maxHp.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: Each use consumes one item and restores its configured amount, capped at maxHp.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: What remains after two teas restore 20 each, starting at 40 HP?
> 80 HP and zero teas. -> correct
> 40 HP and two teas. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
ginger: Each use consumes one item and restores its configured amount, capped at maxHp.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: Each use consumes one item and restores its configured amount, capped at maxHp.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
